# Deterministic line endings for a public, cross-platform source tree.
#
# Why this file exists: the v0.4.0 release package was built on a machine whose
# global `core.autocrlf=true` re-expanded some files from LF to CRLF, so the
# working tree and the packaged ZIP did not match the committed blobs. Pinning
# the policy here removes that class of surprise: the same bytes are checked out
# on Windows, macOS and Linux, and a fresh build is reproducible.
#
# Source files are stored and checked out as LF. Binary assets are never
# converted.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.zip binary
